       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">NATIONAL</span> · The Hindu · 2026-11-09 · editor 9/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>Akhilesh Yadav Schedules Ayodhya Ram Temple Visit for December 12</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#national</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>Samajwadi Party president Akhilesh Yadav has announced his first visit to the Ayodhya Ram Temple on December 12. Analysts view the move as an attempt to broaden the party's PDA outreach beyond traditional support bases and blunt the BJP's anti-Hindu rhetoric ahead of upcoming Assembly polls.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-11-09/akhilesh-yadav-schedules-ayodhya-ram-temple-visit-for-decemb.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>The visit has triggered a political dispute, with Uttar Pradesh Chief Minister Yogi Adityanath demanding an apology for past actions against temple devotees. While the BJP labels the trip politically motivated, SP leaders maintain that faith is a personal issue and argue the BJP is attempting to avoid scrutiny of its governance record.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: Accurately summarizes the political context and stated motivations for the visit while maintaining brevity.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/uttar-pradesh/akhileshs-proposed-ayodhya-visit-to-broaden-his-pda-outreach-say-political-analysts/article71683430.ece" rel="noopener">The Hindu</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       <div class="cityguide"><b>City guide</b><p>More on <a href="https://bharatdn.com/city/ayodhya/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Ayodhya</a> - census 2011 population, live weather and air quality, local food and getaways.</p></div>
       <div class="sharebar" data-href="/article/2026-11-09/akhilesh-yadav-schedules-ayodhya-ram-temple-visit-for-decemb" data-title="Akhilesh Yadav Schedules Ayodhya Ram Temple Visit for December 12"><b>Share:</b>
