     <article class="story single" data-beat="positive">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">POSITIVE</span> · The Better India · 2026-11-09 · editor 10/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>Chennai Startup EarthFokus Saves 5 Billion Litres of Water for 130+ Buildings</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#EarthFokus</span> <span>#Water Conservation</span> <span>#IIT Madras</span> <span>#Startup</span></div>
       <p>Chennai-based startup EarthFokus, incubated by IIT Madras and founded in 2019 by Arun Subramanian and Rishi Vandan, has helped over 130 commercial buildings save more than five billion litres of water. The company addresses water wastage through three distinct solutions: WaterOS, EcoVapure, and WaterFokus.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-11-09/chennai-startup-earthfokus-saves-5-billion-litres-of-water-f.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>WaterOS uses IoT-enabled sensors to monitor consumption in real-time, identifying hidden leaks and unusual usage patterns that monthly bills miss. EcoVapure recovers water from cooling tower evaporation using a technology called Capture, which can recover roughly 30% of evaporation loss. WaterFokus reduces consumption at the source using low-flow fixtures and aerators that maintain stream pressure while cutting water usage.</p><p>The startup’s impact is evident in its client WeWork India, which saw consumption drop from 45 litres per person per day to 29 litres after implementing EarthFokus’s monitoring systems. The company also reported that its interventions at Cognizant’s Chennai operations cut daily water demand by nearly 80%. Founded during Chennai’s Day Zero water crisis, EarthFokus aims to scale its cooling-tower recovery technology internationally.</p><p>Why it matters: EarthFokus demonstrates how precise monitoring and targeted technology can achieve massive water savings without altering daily habits.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The draft provides an excellent, dense summary of the startup's history, technologies, and client impact.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://thebetterindia.com/startup/smart-water-management-buildings-water-saving-earthfokus-startup-chennai-india-12789754" rel="noopener">The Better India</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       <div class="cityguide"><b>City guide</b><p>More on <a href="https://bharatdn.com/city/chennai/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Chennai</a> - census 2011 population, live weather and air quality, local food and getaways.</p></div>
       <div class="sharebar" data-href="/article/2026-11-09/chennai-startup-earthfokus-saves-5-billion-litres-of-water-f" data-title="Chennai Startup EarthFokus Saves 5 Billion Litres of Water for 130+ Buildings"><b>Share:</b>
