       <h1>Rajnath Singh Reviews LAC Infrastructure, Trishakti Corps Readiness at Sukna</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#Rajnath Singh</span> <span>#LAC</span> <span>#Trishakti Corps</span> <span>#Defence</span></div>
       <p>Defence Minister Rajnath Singh has reviewed the infrastructure along the Line of Actual Control (LAC) and the military readiness of the Trishakti Corps at Sukna, according to Defence Watch.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-11-09/rajnath-singh-reviews-lac-infrastructure-trishakti-corps-rea.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>The review focused on the logistical and structural preparations in the region, assessing the current state of military facilities and personnel deployment. The visit underscores the ongoing emphasis on strengthening border infrastructure to support operational requirements in the area.</p><p>What to watch: Further announcements regarding LAC infrastructure upgrades and corps-level operational capacities.</p>
