      <ul><li><a href="https://www.news18.com/world/republican-lawmaker-thomas-massie-pete-hegseth-impeachment-pentagon-chief-reacts-10419330.html" rel="noopener">News18 World</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
